# ---- Demos 教程注解（atlantis_ascent.lua）----
msgid "This scenario demonstrates the use of the Shuttle ascent autopilot in Orbiter."
msgstr "本场景演示 Orbiter 中航天飞机上升自动驾驶仪的使用。"

msgid "The autopilot is accessed via the AscentAP MFD mode, already activated in the left MFD."
msgstr "自动驾驶仪通过 AscentAP MFD 模式访问，该模式已在左侧 MFD 中激活。"

msgid "We first need to set the parameters of the orbit."
msgstr "我们首先需要设置轨道参数。"

msgid "Adjust the altitude of the target circular orbit with AL- and AL+."
msgstr "用 AL- 和 AL+ 调整目标圆轨道的高度。"

msgid "Adjust the launch azimuth (the initial heading) with AZ- and AZ+. The launch azimuth determines the inclination of the final orbit, which must be matched with the rendezvous target."
msgstr "用 AZ- 和 AZ+ 调整发射方位角（初始航向）。发射方位角决定最终轨道的倾角，必须与交会目标匹配。"

msgid "Wait for your launch window, then press L to initiate the launch sequence."
msgstr "等待发射窗口，然后按 L 开始发射序列。"

msgid "Watch the Shuttle make its way to orbit."
msgstr "观看航天飞机飞向轨道。"

# ---- Demos 教程注解（AtmAutopilot.lua）----
msgid "This tutorial gives a brief hands-on demonstration of the Delta-glider's atmospheric autopilot."
msgstr "本教程演示三角滑翔机大气自动驾驶仪的简要实操。"

msgid "\n\nThe autopilot can be programmed via the Script MFD.\nYou should see the terminal in the display at the lower left of the window. If it doesn't show, terminate the simulation and make sure that the \"LuaMFD\" module is activated."
msgstr "\n\n自动驾驶仪可通过脚本 MFD 编程。\n你应该能在窗口左下角显示器中看到终端。如果没有显示，请终止模拟并确认已激活 \"LuaMFD\" 模块。"

msgid "First, we set the target airspeed. Press the MFD button labelled 'INP' and type the following text into the input box:\n\naap.spd(300)\n\n(aap.spd is the airspeed autopilot, and 300 is the target speed in m/s)\n\nPress Enter to submit the command."
msgstr "首先设置目标空速。按标有 'INP' 的 MFD 按钮，并在输入框中输入以下文本：\n\naap.spd(300)\n\n（aap.spd 是空速自动驾驶仪，300 是目标速度，单位 m/s）\n\n按 Enter 提交命令。"

msgid "Good. The glider now fires its main engines and starts to roll. At a ground speed of 100m/s, pull the stick to rotate."
msgstr "很好。滑翔机现在点燃主发动机并开始滑跑。当对地速度达到 100m/s 时，拉杆抬头。"

msgid "Excellent. Now raise the gear. Either simply press the \"G\" key, or enter the following into the MFD:\n\nV:Gear(UP)\n\n(note the capital 'V'. Terminal input is case-sensitive.)"
msgstr "很好。现在收起起落架。可以直接按 \"G\" 键，或在 MFD 中输入：\n\nV:Gear(UP)\n\n（注意大写的 'V'。终端输入区分大小写。）"

msgid "Now, let's set target altitude. Enter the following text in the MFD:\n\naap.alt(10e3)\n\n(This sets the target altitude to 10km.)\n\nMake sure you don't crash into the ground while programming the autopilot!"
msgstr "现在设置目标高度。在 MFD 中输入以下文本：\n\naap.alt(10e3)\n\n（这会把目标高度设为 10km。）\n\n在编程自动驾驶仪时注意不要撞地！"

msgid "As we approach the target altitude, the autopilot levels out the climb angle."
msgstr "当我们接近目标高度时，自动驾驶仪会改平爬升角。"

msgid "You can reset the target speed simply by entering a new value. Enter the following in the MFD:\n\naap.spd(600)"
msgstr "只需输入新值即可重置目标速度。在 MFD 中输入：\n\naap.spd(600)"

msgid "Reaching the new target speed. The same mechanism works for resetting the target altitude. Enter this in the MFD:\n\naap.alt(20e3)"
msgstr "正在达到新的目标速度。同样的机制也适用于重置目标高度。在 MFD 中输入：\n\naap.alt(20e3)"

msgid "The autopilot only controls the main engines. However, if you engage the glider's scram engines manually, the main engines will be throttled down automatically to maintain the target speed.\n\nTry it by setting the scram engines with [Alt]-[+] and [Alt]-[-] (The Alt key and the + and - keys on the numeric keypad)."
msgstr "自动驾驶仪只控制主发动机。但如果你手动开启滑翔机的冲压发动机，主发动机会自动收油门以保持目标速度。\n\n试试用 [Alt]-[+] 和 [Alt]-[-] 设置冲压发动机（Alt 键和数字小键盘上的 + / - 键）。"

msgid "You can manually override the autopilot settings.\nPull the stick to climb to 25km."
msgstr "你可以手动覆盖自动驾驶仪的设置。\n拉杆爬升到 25km。"

msgid "\nNow release the stick to allow the autopilot to return to its target altitude."
msgstr "\n现在松开杆，让自动驾驶仪回到目标高度。"

msgid "Certain combinations of speed and altitude cannot be sustained by the glider. Try resetting the target speed back to 250 m/s.\n(Turn off scram engines if still engaged)"
msgstr "某些速度与高度的组合滑翔机无法维持。试着把目标速度重置回 250 m/s。\n（如果冲压发动机还开着，请关闭）"

msgid "The autopilot pitches up in an attempt to maintain the target altitude."
msgstr "自动驾驶仪会抬头以试图维持目标高度。"

msgid "Eventually, even with fully extended elevator, the glider can't maintain an altitude of 20km at a speed of 250m/s.\nIt sinks until the denser air produces sufficient lift to balance the gravitational force."
msgstr "最终，即使升降舵完全伸出，滑翔机也无法在 250m/s 下维持 20km 高度。\n它会下沉，直到更稠密的空气产生足够升力来平衡重力。"

msgid "This concludes the tutorial. If you want, stay in the air and experiment with the autopilot settings."
msgstr "本教程到此结束。如果你愿意，可以留在空中继续试验自动驾驶仪设置。"

msgid "If you want to find out more details about the atmospheric autopilot, type:\n\nhelp(dg_aap)\n\ninto the MFD. This will bring up a help page."
msgstr "如果想了解更多大气自动驾驶仪的细节，请在 MFD 中输入：\n\nhelp(dg_aap)\n\n这会打开帮助页。"

# ---- Demos 教程注解（Spin_stabilisation.lua）----
msgid "Space physics: Spin stabilisation"
msgstr "空间物理：自旋稳定"

msgid "\n\nThe attitude of an object can be stabilised by spinning\nit rapidly around one of its axes of symmetry. In this\nscenario, two rockets are placed in a low orbit. One is\nspinning around its longitudinal axis at 1Hz, the other\nis not."
msgstr "\n\n让物体绕其某一对称轴快速自旋可以稳定其姿态。在本场景中，两枚火箭被送入低轨道：一枚以 1Hz 绕纵轴自旋，另一枚不自旋。"

msgid "\n\nThe spinning rocket maintains its global orientation,\nwhile the other starts to rotate under the influence of\ngravity gradient torque."
msgstr "\n\n自旋的火箭保持其全局指向，而另一枚则在重力梯度力矩作用下开始转动。"

msgid "If the effect doesn't show, make sure that\nthe Gravity gradient torque option is ticked in the Parameters\ntab of the Orbiter Launchpad."
msgstr "如果没有看到该效果，请确认在 Orbiter 启动器的参数页中勾选了\"重力梯度力矩\"选项。"

msgid "Speeding up the simulation time ..."
msgstr "正在加快模拟时间……"

msgid "Note how the rocket in front starts to rotate\nunder the influence of the gravity gradient, while the\nspinning rocket behind maintains its attitude with\nrespect to the global (non-rotating) frame of reference."
msgstr "注意前方的火箭如何在重力梯度影响下开始转动，而后方自旋的火箭相对全局（非旋转）参考系保持姿态。"

msgid "(Dipping into Earth's shadow ...)"
msgstr "（进入地球阴影……）"

msgid "I am now going to stop the spinning rocket.\nWatch how it also slowly starts to rotate in the inhomogeneous\ngravity field."
msgstr "现在我要停止自旋的火箭。\n观察它如何在非均匀引力场中缓慢开始转动。"

msgid "Now I am spinning up the other rocket.\nAs a result, it will maintain the orientation of its\nlongitudinal axis."
msgstr "现在我要让另一枚火箭自旋起来。\n结果它将保持其纵轴指向。"
